stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> offered: Sender gửi FILE_OFFER -> Server cấp file_id & báo Receiver
  offered --> rejected: Receiver gửi FILE_REJECT
  offered --> accepted: Receiver gửi FILE_ACCEPT
  offered --> aborted: Sender hoặc Receiver mất kết nối (abort_for)
  accepted --> relaying: Sender đẩy chunk đầu tiên lên UDP stream (100 + file_id)
  relaying --> relaying: Server chuyển tiếp từng chunk (1100B) trong RAM -> Receiver ghi vào .part
  relaying --> done: Receiver kiểm tra khớp SHA-256 -> os.replace(.part) & gửi FILE_DONE(ok=True)
  relaying --> failed: Sai SHA-256 -> Receiver xóa .part & gửi FILE_DONE(ok=False)
  relaying --> aborted: Một bên rớt mạng giữa chừng -> Server/Client hủy & báo FILE_DONE(ok=False)
  rejected --> [*]
  done --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  aborted --> [*]

